<section image-layout="blank" id="OAGeWAnrd6"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="xNSNB7prms"><h2>Three leading risks could break the plan</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><table col-widths="[18,12,14,38,18]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false"><tbody><tr><td><p>Leading risk</p></td><td><p>Current</p></td><td><p>Guardrail / target</p></td><td><p>Required response</p></td><td><p>Owner</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Demand</b><br>Pipeline coverage</p></td><td background-color="palette-3"><p><b>2.7×</b></p></td><td><p>3.0×</p></td><td><p>Sales intervenes if mid-quarter coverage remains below 2.8×.</p></td><td><p>Sales</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Adoption</b><br>Onboarding time</p></td><td background-color="palette-3"><p><b>18 days</b></p></td><td><p>14 days</p></td><td><p>Recover onboarding performance to the stated target.</p></td><td><p>Customer leadership</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Concentration</b><br>Top-ten revenue share</p></td><td background-color="palette-3"><p><b>34%</b></p></td><td><p>30%</p></td><td><p>Monitor exposure while commercial capacity shifts toward expansion.</p></td><td><p>Finance</p></td></tr></tbody></table><aside variant="warning"><p>All three signals are outside their guardrail or target before the quarter begins.</p></aside></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="UotTMWoZcz"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="N3b49-LU3U"><h2>Three leadership choices unlock the next quarter</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative decision asks and targets — not company data.</b></p><h3 role="subheading">The package addresses adoption, discounting, and expansion capacity together.</h3><table col-widths="[12,25,20,16,27]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false"><tbody><tr><td><p>Decision</p></td><td><p>Choice</p></td><td><p>Risk or driver</p></td><td><p>Commitment</p></td><td><p>Illustrative target</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="accent"><p><b>APPROVE</b></p></td><td><p><b>Fund the onboarding intervention</b><br>Create a dedicated pod.</p></td><td><p>Adoption<br>18 days versus 14-day target</p></td><td><p><b>$0.4M</b></p></td><td><p>Reach 14 days and recover 1 retention point.</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="accent"><p><b>APPROVE</b></p></td><td><p><b>Protect price discipline</b><br>Require CFO exceptions.</p></td><td><p>Discounting<br>Visible margin leak</p></td><td><p><b>12%</b> guardrail</p></td><td><p>Protect 0.3 margin points.</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="accent"><p><b>CONFIRM</b></p></td><td><p><b>Rebalance commercial capacity</b><br>Shift open roles to expansion.</p></td><td><p>Expansion coverage<br>Retention constraint</p></td><td><p><b>2 open roles</b></p></td><td><p>Make expansion the next unit of commercial capacity.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="1mp6H32b8e"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="S-Efe58Nvt"><h2>The next-quarter plan links each action to an outcome</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="yuTU44RqEe" colspan="15"><p font-size="30pt"><b>$26.0M</b></p><h4>Revenue</h4><p font-size="16pt">Quarter-end target</p></grid-item><grid-item id="8FtPwYyi9u" colspan="15"><p font-size="30pt"><b>62%</b></p><h4>Gross margin</h4><p font-size="16pt">Quarter-end target</p></grid-item><grid-item id="3PF9u5FUj-" colspan="15"><p font-size="30pt"><b>109%</b></p><h4>Retention</h4><p font-size="16pt">Quarter-end target</p></grid-item><grid-item id="2jkHmStH3Z" colspan="15"><p font-size="30pt"><b>$0.2M</b></p><h4>Free cash flow</h4><p font-size="16pt">Positive at quarter end</p></grid-item></grid><spacer size="14pt"></spacer><h3>Action-to-outcome map</h3><table col-widths="[15,33,28,24]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false"><tbody><tr><td><p>Timing</p></td><td><p>Action</p></td><td><p>Leading evidence</p></td><td><p>Outcome moved</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Days 1–30</b></p></td><td><p>Staff the onboarding pod and publish pricing rules.</p></td><td><p>Pod staffed; pricing-compliance baseline established.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Onboarding time<br>Gross margin</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Days 31–60</b></p></td><td><p>Reduce the backlog and activate expansion plays.</p></td><td><p>Onboarding trends toward 14 days; expansion coverage is live.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Retention</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Quarter end</b></p></td><td><p>Scale only interventions that moved their leading indicators.</p></td><td><p>Guardrails hold and cash is positive.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Revenue · margin<br>Retention · cash</p></td></tr></tbody></table></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="q1EwWyu_Qr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="JBPrIAp-x9" vertical-align="center" colspan="43"><p role="eyebrow">Leadership operating loop</p><h2 font-size="34pt">Close the loop: decide, measure, adapt</h2><p font-size="18pt"><b>Today:</b> approve, adjust, or defer the three proposed choices.</p><p font-size="13pt"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><grid divider="sm palette-5" marker="number" marker-style="solid" marker-shape="circle" marker-position="inline" direction="vertical" spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-inline-size: 30pt; --marker-gap: 12pt;"><grid-item id="IsD1I75cXY" padding="9pt 0"><h4>Today · ELT decides</h4><p font-size="16pt">Set the onboarding, pricing, and capacity interventions and confirm owners.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="PZneP-5dfj" padding="9pt 0"><h4>Day 30 · COO and CFO measure</h4><p font-size="16pt">Report pod staffing, pricing compliance, pipeline coverage, and onboarding time.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="-jOwRK1Bzp" padding="9pt 0"><h4>Day 60 · ELT adapts</h4><p font-size="16pt">Release contingency capacity if coverage remains below 2.8× or onboarding remains above 14 days.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="KgXuriH4nn" padding="9pt 0"><h4>Quarter end · ELT assesses</h4><p font-size="16pt">Scale only if revenue, margin, retention, and cash improve together.</p></grid-item></grid><spacer size="12pt"></spacer><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="FOTt-SHdLu" background-color="accent" padding="10pt 14pt"><p font-size="17pt"><b>Decision rule:</b> no scaling without leading-indicator proof.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="Ox2nw-WytX" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.2" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt" colspan="17"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/E3saE4HNdEA3QgB0bVJSf.png" saved-media-id="6fidw9fjfzf7i2s" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="causal-model-studio" alt="Editorial studio photograph of a closed-loop tabletop operating model made from matte warm-white card and machined aluminum, four linked stations connected by a continuous graphite rail, one signal-red decision lever and restrained green indicators showing protected value returning to the starting gate, crisp directional light, no text, lettering, screens, logos, or people." meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><p role="caption">Concept model · operating loop, not company evidence.</p></grid-item></grid></section>